.TH SDL_ReloadGamepadMappings 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_ReloadGamepadMappings \- Reinitialize the SDL mapping database to its initial state.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gamepad.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_ReloadGamepadMappings(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This will generate gamepad events as needed if device mappings change\[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

